#subtitle: Working hours, safety regulations, and unemployment insurance.

= Labor Rights

With control of the Labor Ministry, we can set national standards for labor. The Social Democrats expect us to enforce a 40-hour work week and enforce safety regulations, the Market Liberals are willing to accept this in exchange for privatisation.

# enforce a 40-hour work week
# develop and enforce safety regulations in mines and industries
# works councils are part of another card...

